% (curl -LH 'Accept: application/x-bibtex' https://doi.org/<DOI>) or via the Crossref
% transform endpoint. Nothing was typed from memory.
%
% Scope: the standard theory the project's model and objective rest on (OU processes,
% stationary covariance via the Lyapunov equation, generalized variance, Gaussian
